{"author":"Unknown","author_email":"","data":{"content_hash":"c5f5cecf913b5243ed4e1c9d44d1d8f41356be3734cbf04aa185b7f379bec6b9","digest":{"component_or_area":"audit-trail UI","key_entities":["rebar audit serve","reviewbot FastAPI app","plan-review v2","code-review v2","completion criteria[]","finding-provenance","block_threshold","blocking_enabled","pass-1..4","coaching[]","[ui] extra","nava-rebar[ui]","loopback binding"],"problem_keywords":["audit trail","llm review gates","plan review","code review","completion verification","review history","four-pass breakdown","read-only ui","web interface"],"propositions":["Auditors need a read-only local web UI to review LLM review gate decisions (plan review, code review, completion verification) for a single ticket with full four-pass breakdown per finding.","The UI must display enriched audit data from the data-enrichment epic (Epic 1) including findings, criteria, evidence, verification results, per-finding resolved thresholds, and decision reasons.","Users must be able to navigate and view the history of both plan-review and code-review rounds, selecting older rounds to display their distinct content separately from the latest.","The feature is optional and disabled by default, implemented as a lazy-imported FastAPI+Jinja2 subcommand (rebar audit serve) bound to loopback, with no data-model or schema changes required.","When disabled or its extra is not installed, rebar must behave identically to today with no web dependencies imported."]},"digest_hash_version":1,"model":"bedrock:us.anthropic.claude-opus-4-8","schema":"ticket_digest_v1"},"env_id":"b2b5c498-2f67-4ae3-bafc-eca40294bec2","event_type":"TICKET_DIGEST","timestamp":1785818429413584954,"uuid":"766f054f-dbc6-4d0c-b4f5-bd392a424ec7"}